# Committed (NOT .env.local) on purpose: this is a PUBLIC art-host URL, no
# secret. Vite inlines VITE_* at BUILD time, and .env.local is gitignored so it
# never ships — that's why the DEPLOYED HQ showed blank characters (it fell back
# to DATA_ROOT='' and fetched art from its own origin, which the SPA rewrite
# answered with index.html → JSON.parse failed → blank). Character art (the
# 900MB Kingdom Heroes sheets) can't be bundled into HQ, so the embed fetches it
# cross-origin from the Kingdom host (CORS: Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *).
# Same value LashiraBloom uses. Loaded only for `vite build` (production mode),
# so local dev still uses .env.local.
VITE_KINGDOM_DATA_BASE=https://kingdom-smoky.vercel.app
